{"id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-deterministic-work-space.md","title":"Deterministic Work-Space Complexity","display":"df-deterministic-space-complexity — Deterministic Work-Space Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","aliases":["73-df-deterministic-work-space","73-df-deterministic-space-complexity"],"display":"df-deterministic-space-complexity — Deterministic Work-Space Complexity","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-deterministic-work-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-deterministic-work-space</span><span>73-df-deterministic-space-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-space-complexity — Deterministic Work-Space Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HaltingRun}\">\\(\\operatorname{HaltingRun}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>。</li>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的定义中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选对象；在其后的机器子句中，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge2\">\\(k\\ge2\\)</span>。分量均是这个固定元组的唯一投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\">\\(\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VisitedWork}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{VisitedWork}_M\\)</span> 的参数；空间函数以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{DSPACE}\\)</span> 中量化的每台机器使用其自身的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span> 实例。</li>\n<li>输入边界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1\">\\(-1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|\">\\(|w|\\)</span>，均不计工作空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 保留原来只检查停机运行的条件。非停机输入没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{space}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{space}_M\\)</span> 的数值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\Gamma\\,\\exists\\mathrm{blank}\\,\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq2}\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\n\\exists q_0\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{acc}}\\,\\exists q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(q,\\mathbf a)\\in(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\\,\n\\forall q&#39;\\in Q\\,\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\forall\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\delta(q,\\mathbf a)=(q&#39;,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\to b_1=a_1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(q,\\mathbf a)\\in(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\})\\times\\Gamma^k\\,\n\\forall q&#39;\\in Q\\,\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\Gamma^k\\,\\forall\\mathbf D\\in\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\delta(q,\\mathbf a)=(q&#39;,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf D)\\to b_1=a_1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,\\rho)\\to\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\n\\exists q\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land-1\\leq h_1\\leq|w|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,\\rho)\\to\n\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\n\\exists q\\in Q\\,\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land-1\\leq h_1\\leq|w|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VisitedWork}_M(\\rho,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{(j,z)\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\times\\mathbb Z:\n\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\,\\exists q\\in Q\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land h_j=z\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VisitedWork}_M(\\rho,m)\\coloneqq\n\\{(j,z)\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\times\\mathbb Z:\n\\exists i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\,\\exists q\\in Q\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\in(\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z})^k\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf h\\in\\mathbb Z^k\\;\n\\rho(i)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\land h_j=z\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{space}_M\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(w,r)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\bigl(\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n(\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,\\rho)\\land n=|\\operatorname{VisitedWork}_M(\\rho,m)|)\\},r\\bigr)\n\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{space}_M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{space}_M\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(w,r)\\in\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\bigl(\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\\;\n(\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,\\rho)\\land n=|\\operatorname{VisitedWork}_M(\\rho,m)|)\\},r\\bigr)\n\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{space}_M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{space}_M)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{space}_M\\land r\\le c\\,s(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{space}_M)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{space}_M\\land r\\le c\\,s(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> requires at least one work tape in addition to the read-only input tape, so the local hypothesis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq2\">\\(k\\geq2\\)</span> survives the existential machine quantifier in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{DSPACE}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Tape <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> is read-only and uncharged, but its head is confined to the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|+2\">\\(|w|+2\\)</span> positions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\">\\(-1,0,\\ldots,|w|\\)</span>; hence it cannot act as free unbounded storage and the bounded-space configuration set remains finite.</li>\n<li>Only distinct cells visited on work tapes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2,\\ldots,k\">\\(2,\\ldots,k\\)</span> count.</li>\n<li>Determinism and the absence of outgoing transitions from halting states make the minimizing set a singleton whenever the machine halts.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\operatorname{HaltingRun}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]，$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conv