HeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{space}_M)=\\mathbf2^*\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{space}_M\\land r\\le c\\,s(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"|w|+2","display":false},{"tex":"-1,0,\\ldots,|w|","display":false},{"tex":"2,\\ldots,k","display":false}],"bytes":4704,"backlinks":[{"id":"79e0c730e7cd49f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DSPACE}$ (deterministic work-space classes, see [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]])"},{"id":"cadee7248274622b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\Sigma}$, $\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}$, $\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\Sigma}$, and $\\operatorname{space}_M$ (work-tape model and usage, see [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]])"},{"id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$；工作机、只读输入、输入读头边界、$\\operatorname{space}_M$ 见 [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]。"},{"id":"4f6c74e9e6793301","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"708dbbb6cfe69b79","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DSPACE}$ (deterministic work-space classes, see [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]])"}],"outgoing":["8658210215541698","9fa7db79fea5f29a","773cae915e5165f3"]}